Dialogue: 99,0:00:02.27,0:00:04.48,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Mai avem până în Romca?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:05.19,0:00:07.61,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,The Great Mountain Wall was exhausting too,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:07.61,0:00:09.46,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,and it's been nothing but mountain roads!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:09.46,0:00:11.94,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Is this how a nation's \Nprincess should travel?!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:12.26,0:00:14.16,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,You're full of complaints.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:14.16,0:00:15.41,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Vrei să te car în spate?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:15.41,0:00:16.62,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Nu mersi!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:17.06,0:00:20.11,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Look, it's coming into view.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:22.68,0:00:26.41,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,This is how Romca was truly meant to look.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:01.65,0:02:04.14,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,Nefritis, mă poți auzi?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:04.14,0:02:07.72,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,Ți-am adus cartea pe care voiai s-o citești.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:07.72,0:02:09.41,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,Sunt eu, fratele tău.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:09.41,0:02:11.02,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,Deschide ușa, te rog.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:11.30,0:02:13.59,Dialogue,Elf,0,0,0,,Prințule Jade, \Nprințesa Nefritis tocmai s-a...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:14.07,0:02:17.47,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,Se pare că Nefritis s-a închis \Ndin nou în camera ei.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:17.47,0:02:20.32,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,Nimeni din palat nu a mai \Nvăzut-o pe Nefritis din acea zi.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:20.32,0:02:22.58,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,No one has seen what lies \Nbehind this door either.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:22.58,0:02:24.77,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,Which means that so long \Nas this door remains closed,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:24.77,0:02:27.17,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,no one can prove that Nefritis isn't here.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:25.75,0:02:29.46,Dialogue,Elf,0,0,0,,{\an8}He became like this \Nshortly after you left Romca,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:27.17,0:02:30.41,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,No, she is in here!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:29.46,0:02:31.29,Dialogue,Elf,0,0,0,,{\an8}and he's been this way the whole time.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:32.61,0:02:33.67,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Frate mai mare...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:33.96,0:02:35.19,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.63,0:02:38.61,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,Nefufu—!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:38.61,0:02:39.55,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,Nef—!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:39.55,0:02:40.68,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,Nefriti—!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:40.68,0:02:44.01,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,Nu! Nefritis e în acea cameră!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:44.34,0:02:47.02,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,Tu cine ești?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:49.10,0:02:51.90,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,Îmi cer scuze pentru că \Nmi-am pierdut cumpătul.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:52.46,0:02:54.36,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,So what did you need?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:54.83,0:02:58.17,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,The Elves' Great Library. \NWe'd like to see it.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.64,0:03:02.73,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,I've gathered all of the rings, \Nbut I'm still not a match for the Abyss King.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:02.73,0:03:06.83,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,So I want to know more about \Nthe Abyss King and the past Ring King.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.21,0:03:11.33,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,The Great Library \Nwould certainly hold tomes on that.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:11.33,0:03:15.13,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,Though that's also our people's graveyard.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:15.48,0:03:16.27,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Graveyard?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.02,0:03:18.82,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,The Great Library
Dialogue: 99,0:03:18.82,0:03:22.91,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,that houses the books \Ncontaining our knowledge
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.34,0:03:26.39,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,is only opened when an elf dies.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.66,0:03:28.22,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,But Brother...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:31.82,0:03:34.14,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,You should try asking the Elder.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.14,0:03:37.19,Dialogue,Jade,0,0,0,,She's in charge of the key to the Library.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:39.35,0:03:40.81,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Hey, Grandpa,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:40.81,0:03:44.93,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,when and how did the Abyss King \Ncome to be in the first place?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.93,0:03:47.31,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Hmm... To be honest,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.31,0:03:52.98,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,no one has a clear answer on \Nwhen or how he came to be.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:52.98,0:03:54.71,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,I should've known.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:54.97,0:03:58.18,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Long ago, the world was in balance.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:58.18,0:04:02.68,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,An endless equilibrium between \Nthe Abyss and "living people."
Dialogue: 99,0:04:04.05,0:04:06.64,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Darkness poured from the north,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:06.64,0:04:08.48,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,taking the form of monsters,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:08.48,0:04:12.14,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,and the darkness of the Abyss \Nattacked and infected people.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:12.14,0:04:15.20,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Those who were infected would die,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:15.20,0:04:17.50,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,their bodies vanishing without a trace.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:18.11,0:04:21.08,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,People used all the wisdom \Nand courage they possessed,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:21.08,0:04:24.72,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,constantly fighting against the Abyss \Nwith swords and magic.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:25.38,0:04:28.80,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Then the balance suddenly broke.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:33.14,0:04:35.17,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,The king of the monsters...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:35.17,0:04:39.31,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,The Abyss King—darkness in \Nhuman form—had appeared.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:40.33,0:04:42.91,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,The monsters were organized \Ninto armies under him,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:42.91,0:04:45.01,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,and they began flooding out of the north.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:45.34,0:04:49.31,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,The people fought to defend their nations.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:49.62,0:04:54.68,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Yet they were defeated by \Nthe Abyss King's overwhelming power,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:54.68,0:04:56.13,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,and the darkness of the Abyss
Dialogue: 99,0:04:56.13,0:05:00.02,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,spread so far, it nearly swallowed the world.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:01.17,0:05:04.49,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,So the Abyss King appeared from the Abyss?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:05.88,0:05:10.20,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Then the Ring King appeared as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:11.02,0:05:12.43,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,S-So then?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:12.43,0:05:13.66,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:13.94,0:05:18.63,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,What happened afterward \Nwas never passed down to anyone.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:21.29,0:05:23.37,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,You want into the Elves' Great Library?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:23.37,0:05:24.34,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:24.34,0:05:26.05,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,I can't permit that.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:26.32,0:05:27.76,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Wh-Why not?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:27.76,0:05:32.41,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,I know you saw it for yourself too. \NThat black ring.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.41,0:05:36.69,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,The Abyss King possesses power \Nthat wasn't spoken of in the myths.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.69,0:05:40.23,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,We need as much knowledge \Nas we can gain right now.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:40.52,0:05:44.54,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,I don't know anything \Nabout those black rings either.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:44.54,0:05:47.38,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,The Great Library contains \Nrecords of the past.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:47.38,0:05:50.95,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,You won't find knowledge \Nabout the present Abyss King.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:54.31,0:05:56.25,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,What is that ring?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:56.66,0:06:00.19,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,They fused into one \Nduring my fight with the Abyss King.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:00.19,0:06:01.92,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,I heard a voice from the ring.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:01.92,0:06:04.63,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,A voice? Was it the Ring King's?!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.05,0:06:06.91,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:06.91,0:06:09.52,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,He spoke to me on occasion before,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:09.52,0:06:11.47,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,but I'm not getting any response now.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:12.63,0:06:15.85,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,So everything is different \Nthan it was in the past?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:17.00,0:06:18.13,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.13,0:06:20.00,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,I'll show you to the Great Library.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:23.68,0:06:26.21,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Um, by the way, Elder?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:26.21,0:06:28.86,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Have you seen Smaragdi-sama around?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:28.86,0:06:33.47,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Yeah. She returned the sacred bird \Nand immediately left for Nokanatika.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:33.47,0:06:35.49,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Maybe you two just missed each other?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:35.49,0:06:37.22,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:37.22,0:06:39.73,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,That's a bit frightening, but also a relief.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:39.73,0:06:44.30,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,I feel like that woman \Ncan be extreme and intense.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:44.30,0:06:46.09,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Even you walk on eggshells around her.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:46.09,0:06:49.30,Dialogue,Smaragdi,0,0,0,,What's all this about eggshells?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:49.56,0:06:51.55,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,N-No! It's nothing like that!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:51.55,0:06:52.73,Dialogue,Smaragdi,0,0,0,,I understand!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:52.73,0:06:55.68,Dialogue,Smaragdi,0,0,0,,I'll hear you out at great length, then!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:56.65,0:06:58.19,Dialogue,Smaragdi,0,0,0,,All by ourselves.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:00.54,0:07:02.10,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:02.49,0:07:05.82,Dialogue,Alabaster,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:13.64,0:07:16.40,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Here at the large tree at the center of Romca,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:16.40,0:07:19.62,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,there's a space formed by \Nthe gaps between its roots
Dialogue: 99,0:07:19.62,0:07:22.08,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,which was used to build \Nthe Elves' Great Library.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.36,0:07:24.63,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,The knowledge of Romca's elves...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:24.93,0:07:26.67,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,This is the accumulation of that?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:26.67,0:07:27.95,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,It's staggering.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:29.73,0:07:31.96,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,{\i1}Research on the Insects Living in Moss{\i0},
Dialogue: 99,0:07:31.96,0:07:34.41,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nokanatika's Home Cooking Volume 3{\i0},
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.41,0:07:37.06,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,{\i1}How Different Races Produce Children{\i0}...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:37.06,0:07:40.59,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Oh? That one's similar to my own research.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:40.59,0:07:42.10,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,How about it, Ring King?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:42.10,0:07:45.17,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Care to show me how you lay \Nwith your wives this time?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:45.17,0:07:47.14,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,You must be used to it by now, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:47.14,0:07:48.65,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,No, actually...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:49.05,0:07:50.63,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,How shy.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:59.71,0:08:01.54,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,This is the deepest section.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:02.18,0:08:07.00,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Nearly all of the books in the world \Nwere lost at the hands of the Abyss King.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.30,0:08:11.80,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Then the few remaining books \Nwere burned by humans.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:12.22,0:08:16.67,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,All so the true shape of the battle \Nbetween Ring King and Abyss King
Dialogue: 99,0:08:16.67,0:08:18.60,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,wouldn't be passed down...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:18.99,0:08:20.56,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Why would they do that?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:20.56,0:08:22.91,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Everyone was afraid.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:22.91,0:08:25.49,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Of the Abyss King, the Ring King,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.49,0:08:27.96,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,and what man is capable of.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:31.94,0:08:34.35,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,This is the first tome we collected
Dialogue: 99,0:08:34.35,0:08:37.52,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,of those that escaped the burning \Nafter the age of the Abyss King.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:37.52,0:08:39.74,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,The answers you seek are in there.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.74,0:08:42.25,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,The author is "Peridot Romca".
Dialogue: 99,0:08:42.25,0:08:43.96,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,This is your book?!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:43.96,0:08:47.08,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Yes. It's a record I left behind.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:47.08,0:08:48.47,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,A memoir of that time.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:49.40,0:08:53.92,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,I was the first Ring Princess.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:58.89,0:09:00.18,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Ring King,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:00.55,0:09:02.60,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,and Maidens of the Rings,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.25,0:09:05.22,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,you should brace yourselves \Nbefore seeing this.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.90,0:09:10.03,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,This is the arm of the first Ring King.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:10.03,0:09:12.87,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,The sin of us Ring Princesses.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:16.03,0:09:20.70,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,One man appeared when the darkness of \Nthe Abyss was swallowing up the world
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.70,0:09:22.41,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,and plunging everyone into despair.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:22.78,0:09:24.90,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,That was the Ring King.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:27.48,0:09:31.17,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,That man, with his powerful magic \Nand brimming confidence,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:31.52,0:09:34.13,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,appeared in Nokanatika when it was \Nsurrounded by armies of monsters
Dialogue: 99,0:09:34.13,0:09:36.05,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,just waiting for its inevitable fall.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:46.13,0:09:49.90,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,He wielded Light magic, \Na magic none had ever seen before.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:53.82,0:09:57.51,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,The Ring's source of power is \Nthe bonds between people.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:57.91,0:10:01.36,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,To draw out more power from \Nthis Ring bestowed upon me by God,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:01.74,0:10:03.58,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,please let me take the beautiful princess
Dialogue: 99,0:10:03.58,0:10:06.25,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,who channels the hearts of \Nher people as my wife.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:09.65,0:10:12.64,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,We were to become the wives of \Nthe hero who would save the world.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:12.64,0:10:14.89,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Nothing could have made us prouder.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:15.53,0:10:20.10,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,So the man took a wife \Nfrom each of the five races.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.10,0:10:24.25,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,We happily chose to become that man's brides.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:24.93,0:10:27.93,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,The Light Princess was kind and pure.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:27.93,0:10:30.94,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,The Wind Princess saw \Na clear vision of the future.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:30.94,0:10:33.69,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,The Fire Princess blazed with fierce courage.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:33.69,0:10:36.53,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,The Water Princess \Nwas brimming with beautiful love.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:36.53,0:10:39.36,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,The Earth Princess \Nwas righteous and quick-witted.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.36,0:10:41.02,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:41.02,0:10:44.20,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Isn't "The Wind Princess saw \Na clear vision of the future"...?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:44.20,0:10:46.48,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,That was me, of course.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:48.33,0:10:50.91,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Every time the Ring King \Nwelcomed a new bride,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:50.91,0:10:54.53,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,he created a new ring \Nthat paired with his own.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:54.53,0:10:56.87,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,He granted one to each of the five races,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:57.53,0:11:00.72,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,and thus the five Wedding Rings were born.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:01.77,0:11:04.75,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,As the hero who would save the world,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:04.75,0:11:06.85,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,his title of Ring King rapidly \Nspread across the world,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:06.85,0:11:09.59,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,and his victories \Ngave the people encouragement.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:09.59,0:11:13.74,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,The hearts of the masses passed \Nthrough their rulers, the princesses,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:13.74,0:11:16.23,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,to join together under the Ring King.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:17.02,0:11:20.44,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,The Ring King fought and brought victory.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:21.11,0:11:23.97,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Then, to reward him for his achievements,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:23.97,0:11:27.80,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,we Ring Princesses offered him \Nour hearts and bodies.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:28.12,0:11:29.08,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Fight,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:29.85,0:11:31.16,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,have sex,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:31.16,0:11:32.12,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,fight,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:32.85,0:11:33.99,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,have sex,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:34.67,0:11:37.34,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,and then off to fight again.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:37.74,0:11:39.59,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Over and over again.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:41.13,0:11:43.36,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,The Ring King was strong.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:43.84,0:11:48.80,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Yet our battles against the forces of \Nthe Abyss King only grew more intense.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:49.50,0:11:53.40,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,After risking his life in battle \Nover the fate of the world,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:57.01,0:12:00.63,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,his heart steadily grew more harrowed.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:01.82,0:12:03.12,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,What remained
Dialogue: 99,0:12:03.12,0:12:06.83,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,was an ordinary man desperately \Nclinging to lust to mask his fears.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.79,0:12:10.45,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Does that shock you?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:10.45,0:12:13.89,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,The Ring King wasn't the great man \Ntales make him out to be.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:13.89,0:12:16.73,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,He wasn't some savior sent by God,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.73,0:12:19.25,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,or some mechanism meant to save the world.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:19.25,0:12:21.76,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Then who on earth was the Ring King?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:22.11,0:12:25.02,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,"The origins of the Ring King \Nwere never clear."
Dialogue: 99,0:12:25.02,0:12:29.56,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,"Was he the descendant of ancient royalty? \NThe child of a sage? An avatar of God?"
Dialogue: 99,0:12:29.56,0:12:31.33,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,"Many rumors were circulated,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:31.33,0:12:34.31,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,but the Ring King never spoke \Non his own origins," it reads.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:34.31,0:12:35.23,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:35.67,0:12:38.43,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,No one truly knew that man.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:38.43,0:12:42.04,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,No, no one ever tried to \Nknow him or believe in him.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:42.86,0:12:45.46,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,This is what he told us:
Dialogue: 99,0:12:45.46,0:12:48.49,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,"I picked up the first Ring in a field."
Dialogue: 99,0:12:48.91,0:12:51.29,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,That man was a simple farmer.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:51.29,0:12:55.17,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Just a genuinely ordinary person \Nlike the rest of us.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:56.83,0:13:00.71,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Eventually the Ring King began \Nto be consumed by his power and desire.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:01.26,0:13:04.61,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,He only saw the women who became \Nhis brides as vessels of power
Dialogue: 99,0:13:04.61,0:13:07.44,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,or objects to slake his lust with,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:07.44,0:13:11.96,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,and he devoured all he could take from us \Nas he tried to draw out more power.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:12.39,0:13:16.20,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,After he took everything, \Nwe were emotionally exhausted.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:16.20,0:13:21.38,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Yet despite it all, our only option was to \Nendure it for the sake of the world.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:22.36,0:13:25.84,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Emotional connections \Nand physical connections
Dialogue: 99,0:13:25.84,0:13:28.82,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,were all the same to the Ring.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:28.82,0:13:32.36,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,So the Ring King was able to unleash \Neven more tremendous power.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:32.36,0:13:36.55,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,It became so great that even the heartless \Nmonsters of the Abyss seemed to cower in fear.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:37.04,0:13:41.38,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,However, that power \Ninstilled fear in his allies as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:41.38,0:13:46.10,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,"Once the Abyss King is defeated, \Nthis man will likely become the next ruler."
Dialogue: 99,0:13:46.10,0:13:47.90,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,"Will the world truly know peace
Dialogue: 99,0:13:47.90,0:13:51.04,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,if it's ruled by this man who's drunk on \Npower and looks down on others?"
Dialogue: 99,0:13:51.35,0:13:54.81,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,The answer that we Ring Princesses reached...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.54,0:13:58.23,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,was to bury the Ring King.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:01.01,0:14:03.65,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,You all are betraying me too?!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:04.13,0:14:07.32,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,I figured this was coming anyway!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:07.32,0:14:08.82,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,Curses upon you!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:08.82,0:14:10.64,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,And the Rings! And the Princesses!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:10.64,0:14:12.20,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,And this world too!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:12.60,0:14:15.16,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,Let the Rings become cursed rings!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:15.16,0:14:17.20,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,Let one be impossible \Nto remove from the Princess,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:17.20,0:14:20.08,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,and let its pair be bestowed upon \Nwhomever kisses the Princess!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:20.08,0:14:24.09,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,Let their fates forever be twisted \Nby those who seek power!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:24.46,0:14:27.68,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,Let your descendants forever suffer
Dialogue: 99,0:14:27.68,0:14:30.14,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,until the world is once more \Nswallowed by the Abyss!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.83,0:14:35.39,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Only one of us, the Light Princess, \Nfelt sorry for the man.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:41.66,0:14:44.51,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,When the Abyss returns once more,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:44.96,0:14:48.95,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,the Light Princess's husband \Nshall become the new Ring King.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:50.95,0:14:55.47,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,After that... The five Rings \Nwere passed down within each nation,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.47,0:14:59.87,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,and we Ring Princesses decided to \Nconceal everything that happened.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:02.14,0:15:06.71,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,The Wedding Rings passed down \Nwithin the five nations
Dialogue: 99,0:15:06.71,0:15:08.26,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,were truly curses.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:09.62,0:15:12.33,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Satou, the moment I first saw you,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:12.33,0:15:15.25,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,I sensed a light of hope \Nthat that wouldn't happen.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:15.25,0:15:18.71,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,So I never wanted to cast \Nany shadows on that light.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:19.31,0:15:24.36,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Though now that you've \Ncome this far as the new Ring King,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:24.36,0:15:26.87,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,I thought I should tell you myself.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:27.56,0:15:30.74,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Well now, I'm sure you all have \Nsome feelings to sort out.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:31.12,0:15:33.50,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,So I'll be heading back now.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:33.50,0:15:37.91,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,I hope that you'll keep what you \Nlearned here within these walls.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:39.07,0:15:42.28,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,A curse surrounding their power...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.53,0:15:45.88,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Well, they were kind of \Nreaping what they sowed
Dialogue: 99,0:15:45.88,0:15:49.30,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,after betraying the Ring King, \Nstealing the Rings, and running home.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:51.50,0:15:53.87,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Since you're their descendants,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:53.87,0:15:58.12,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,you now have to unite around the new \NRing King and fight the Abyss King.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:58.94,0:16:03.07,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Sounds like he was imposing \Nthat responsibility on the traitors.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.98,0:16:07.33,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,{\i1}The power of the Ring...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:07.33,0:16:08.86,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,{\i1}My power...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:08.86,0:16:10.13,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,This voice?!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:10.78,0:16:14.35,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm something like the \Nspirit of the Ring King.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:14.35,0:16:18.24,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, the man I used to be was defeated.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.24,0:16:19.45,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:28.94,0:16:32.05,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,{\i1}I really should be helping you, then.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:32.36,0:16:34.75,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,{\i1}This spirit that was left \Nin the Ring of Light was
Dialogue: 99,0:16:34.75,0:16:37.76,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,{\i1}a portion of the old Ring \NKing's virtuous side.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:37.76,0:16:40.97,Dialogue,FirstRK,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, perhaps I should say I'm his regrets.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:41.35,0:16:43.77,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,You're quite calm.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.77,0:16:46.52,Dialogue,Ring,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm shocked to realize what I am too.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:48.40,0:16:50.53,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Satou? What was that?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.53,0:16:53.24,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,There's been a slight change \Nin the Ring's power.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:53.24,0:16:55.31,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Did anything happen to you?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:55.31,0:16:58.96,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,You didn't have your mind taken over \Nby the first Ring King, did you?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:58.96,0:17:00.33,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:00.33,0:17:04.79,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Nothing happened this time around, \Nand I'm sure I'm fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:05.78,0:17:10.21,Dialogue,Ring,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's nothing you can say \Nto calm their fears right now.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:10.21,0:17:13.08,Dialogue,Ring,0,0,0,,{\i1}Women are so easily swayed by their emotions.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:13.08,0:17:15.38,Dialogue,Ring,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's just how they are.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:15.38,0:17:18.87,Dialogue,Ring,0,0,0,,{\i1}You'll probably understand \Nthat once they kill you too.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:24.19,0:17:27.52,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want more power so I can \Ndefeat the Abyss King.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:27.90,0:17:30.89,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}I could obtain more power \Nif I crossed that line too.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:31.23,0:17:32.90,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nothing wrong with that.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.90,0:17:34.89,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}It would all be what we wanted, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:39.14,0:17:42.26,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Though... Is that really \Nthe right thing to do?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:43.41,0:17:47.25,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I went all-out against the Abyss King,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:47.25,0:17:48.87,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}I actually felt a little excited.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:49.94,0:17:53.00,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}So can I truly claim that I wouldn't be \Nconsumed by the power
Dialogue: 99,0:17:53.00,0:17:55.50,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}like the previous Ring King?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:55.93,0:17:56.91,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Or...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:57.55,0:17:59.66,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,by the desire...?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:00.43,0:18:01.28,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:02.33,0:18:05.38,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,There's something odd about him, isn't there?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:08.62,0:18:09.36,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:09.36,0:18:10.52,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,It's closed tight.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:10.52,0:18:12.52,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Sounds like you're done talking.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:12.82,0:18:13.88,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Elder?!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:13.88,0:18:16.16,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,This door won't open!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:16.16,0:18:17.30,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Ring King.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:17.30,0:18:21.38,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,I want you to obtain the power \Nto defeat the Abyss King here.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:21.38,0:18:22.12,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:22.38,0:18:24.87,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Until you do, I'm keeping this door shut!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:25.13,0:18:26.33,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:26.33,0:18:30.18,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,This entire Library is \Nprotected by powerful magic.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:30.18,0:18:35.07,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,This door is the sole means of entry, \Nand it won't be easy to force open.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:35.07,0:18:36.51,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,So if you want to get out of here,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.51,0:18:39.51,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,then show me you can break \Nthrough this door on your own!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:40.09,0:18:42.22,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Please stand back a bit.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:54.92,0:18:57.45,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Your bonds are pure.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:57.45,0:19:02.33,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,I thought that might be the strength of \Nthe new generation, but it's too unstable.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:03.39,0:19:06.91,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Just look at the state you're all in \Nafter simply hearing my story earlier.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:08.02,0:19:09.12,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Satou.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:09.12,0:19:12.34,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,You haven't laid a hand \Non the Princesses yet, have you?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:12.34,0:19:14.42,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Use this opportunity to get it done.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:14.42,0:19:15.71,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:15.71,0:19:17.90,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,You want power, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:17.90,0:19:19.65,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,I do, but...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:19.65,0:19:20.38,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:21.10,0:19:23.69,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Those days I spent \Nas the Ring King's plaything...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:23.69,0:19:27.81,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,There was no love behind the act, \Nbut it felt truly incredible!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:28.89,0:19:33.10,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Not once in my long life have I ever \Nexperienced greater pleasure than that!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:33.10,0:19:35.69,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Even if the man ultimately \Ndid deserve to die.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:36.02,0:19:39.26,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,That was part of the reason I grew \Ninterested in sex between different races
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.26,0:19:41.61,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,and began researching it.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:41.89,0:19:44.67,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,That pleasure was unique.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:44.67,0:19:48.34,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,I bet it would feel incredible to do it \Nwith the current Ring King, too...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:48.34,0:19:51.08,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,You do possess quite \Na splendid manhood, after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:52.91,0:19:56.97,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,My old research lab was \Nmoved into this Great Library.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:56.97,0:19:59.33,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Go there. And then get to it!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:59.33,0:20:01.08,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Consummate your marriages!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:02.82,0:20:06.36,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,If we don't do anything, \Nwe'll all just wither up and die,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:06.36,0:20:08.89,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,so let's follow the Elder's \Ndirections for now.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:09.17,0:20:09.98,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:09.98,0:20:13.35,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,If it was the Elder's research lab, then...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:23.61,0:20:25.51,Dialogue,Both,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:26.60,0:20:27.20,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:27.57,0:20:30.79,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Make up your mind. \NAre we doing it or not, Ring King?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:30.79,0:20:31.75,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:31.75,0:20:36.49,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,My goal is to bear and raise \Nstrong catfolk children.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:36.49,0:20:39.21,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind if we started \Ntrying to make babies at once.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:39.21,0:20:42.97,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,My resolve has been firm \Nsince the moment I gave you my Ring.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.97,0:20:47.06,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I... I don't mind going after Krystal-sama,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:47.06,0:20:49.76,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,and if you want it too, \Nthen I'm ready anytime...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:49.76,0:20:53.97,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Um, Satou, I know you might have \Nyour concerns about it,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:53.97,0:20:56.40,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,but I don't think we're in a position \Nto worry about that...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:56.75,0:20:58.86,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly okay with it.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:58.86,0:21:02.96,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,But... Even if I do gain power that way, \Nwhat if I end up like the previous Ring King...?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:02.96,0:21:04.61,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,I know you'll be fine!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:04.61,0:21:06.95,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,I know that will never happen!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:06.95,0:21:08.66,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:09.81,0:21:11.30,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Ring King Satou!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:11.62,0:21:15.63,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Be it for power, for love, or for duty...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:15.63,0:21:20.14,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Our reasons may differ, \Nbut all of us are fond of you.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:20.14,0:21:22.09,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,No, I'm not really...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:22.38,0:21:23.63,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,It's time you lay with us!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:23.63,0:21:25.23,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,H-Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:25.86,0:21:27.76,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Then how about this?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:28.89,0:21:33.64,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,You'll spend time alone with him \Nin this room in order to deepen your bonds.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:34.07,0:21:36.23,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,We'll decide the order fairly \Nby drawing straws!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:36.23,0:21:37.73,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Let's do that!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:37.73,0:21:39.81,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Um, what about my opinion?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:39.81,0:21:43.17,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,You'll get to decide what you do with them.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:43.17,0:21:45.69,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,You're welcome \Nto do nothing at all, of course.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:45.69,0:21:48.24,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Whatever happens will remain between you two!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.76,0:21:50.70,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,That's okay, right, Sister?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:52.36,0:21:53.64,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:57.14,0:21:58.21,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Unu.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:58.21,0:21:59.54,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Doi.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:59.54,0:22:00.88,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Trei.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:00.88,0:22:02.21,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Patru.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:03.24,0:22:04.10,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Cinci.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:05.07,0:22:08.79,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eu sunt ultima?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.94,0:18:08.62,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,
